     - The `UserManager` should only handle user-related functionalities, while the `BookManager` should focus solely on book-related operations. This can be further enhanced by separating the file handling logic into a dedicated class or module to improve maintainability.

By implementing these suggestions, the Online Library Management System can become more robust, user-friendly, and maintainable while still adhering to the project's lightweight and simple architecture.
