1. |Case|:**search_books**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION search_books(query: STRING) -> LIST
    results = []
    FOR EACH book IN self.books
        IF query.lower() IN book[0].lower()
            ADD book TO results
        ENDIF
    ENDFOR
    RETURN results
END FUNCTION

# HTML Form for Searching Books
<form method="POST" action="/search_books">
    <label for="query">Search Books:</label>
    <input type="text" id="query" name="query" required>
    <button type="submit">Search</button>
</form>
```
**Key Functionality:**
